11. PERFORMANCE & ACCESSIBILITY
==================================================
- Semantic HTML, alt text on all images, aria-labels on icon buttons, visible focus rings, focus trapped in modals/drawers, WCAG AA contrast (gold text uses Deep gold #8A6A2B; gradient text always dark enough; never light gold text on white).
- SEO: <title>Wear It Better — Luxury Menswear & Artisanal Perfumes</title>, meta description, Open Graph tags, theme-color #FBF8F3, inline SVG favicon of the gold-gradient "W".
- Performance: gradients via CSS only (no gradient images); animate gradient orbs with transform/opacity only; lazy-load below-the-fold images, eager-load the first hero image; memoize filtered lists and context values; passive scroll listeners; no unnecessary re-renders.

